{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
When you {c_important}Evade{/c}, you now burrow underground, immobilizing surrounding enemies for {c_number}{SF_2}{/c} seconds and dealing {c_random}{payload:TOOLTIP_EXIT_DAMAGE}{/c} damage on your entry and exit. You deal {c_random}{payload:TOOLTIP_BURROW_DAMAGE}{/c} damage every {c_number}[{SF_4}|2|]{/c} seconds while burrowed. {c_important}Evade's{/c} Cooldown is increased by {c_number}{SF_3}{/c} seconds, and Cooldown Reduction on {c_important}Evade{/c} is {c_number}[{SF_20}*100|%|]{/c} as effective.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Activating your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power grants you {c_random}[{SF_7}*100|%+|]{/c} increased Dodge chance for {c_number}{SF_8}{/c} seconds. Whenever you Dodge an attack, you Immobilize Nearby enemies for {c_number}{SF_10}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}

{c_important}Main{/c} Entry and Exit Damage {icon:arrow,1.2} {c_random}{c_random}{payload:TOOLTIP_EXIT_DAMAGE_NEXT}{/c}{/c}
{c_important}Main{/c} Burrowed Damage {icon:arrow,1.2} {c_random}{payload:TOOLTIP_BURROW_DAMAGE_NEXT}{/c}
{c_important}Modifier{/c} Dodge Chance {icon:arrow,1.2} {c_random}[{SF_13}*100|+%|]{/c}
